  <result type="3">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of BUK is to give Denmark&apos;s children and their parents a global view and insight into children&apos;s living conditions in different developing countries. BUK must arouse their interest and curiosity in the world around them and increase their understanding of the lives of children in other parts of the world, with the long-term aim of contributing to positive development in developing countries. DR and UM collaborate to continuously develop and strengthen the BUK project.</narrative>
   </title>
